@item
@code{git init}: creates a new git repo, with data stored in the @code{.git} directory
@item
@code{git status}: tells you what's going on
@item
@code{git add <filename>}: adds files to staging area
@item
@code{git commit}: creates a new commit
@itemize
@item
Write @uref{https://tbaggery.com/2008/04/19/a-note-about-git-commit-messages.html,good commit messages}!
