@uref{https://jwiegley.github.io/git-from-the-bottom-up/,Git from the Bottom Up} is a detailed explanation of Git's implementation details beyond just the data model, for the curious.
@item
@uref{https://smusamashah.github.io/blog/2017/10/14/explain-git-in-simple-words,How to explain git in simple words}
